## Purpose and audience
Purpose: Verify MIR lowering of Result method calls (unwrap / unwrap_or /
unwrap_err) and static-method resolution produces the correct payload-extraction
control flow, observed on the lowered MIR artifact.
Audience: compiler and tooling engineers who maintain this spec.
